            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Almacena una cadena en <code>item_2</code> para que el resultado de la comparación sea <code>False</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"item_1 = \" /><text value=\"&quot;deerstalker hat&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"item_2 = \" /><text value=\"&quot;pipe&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"is_duplicate = item_1 == item_2\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;deerstalker hat&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>\"pipe\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>is_duplicate</code> se vuelve <code>True</code> solo cuando ambos elementos son exactamente el mismo string.</p><p>Guarda otra cadena en <code>item_2</code>. Comprueba si son iguales para que <code>is_duplicate</code> sea <code>False</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"item_1 = \" /><text value=\"&quot;deerstalker hat&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"item_2 = \" /><text value=\"&quot;pipe&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"is_duplicate = item_1 == item_2\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option startIndex=\"67\" endIndex=\"69\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;deerstalker hat&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"pipe\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!=\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>\"pipe\"</code> seguido de <code>==</code>.</p></body></html>",
