            "title": "Inequality operator",
            "id": 76680,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Para verificar si una cadena no es igual a otra cadena, usamos el <strong>operador de desigualdad</strong>, <code>!=</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;subscribed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" != \" /><text value=\"&quot;rejected&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"True\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>!=</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Para verificar si un string no es igual a otro string, usamos el <strong>operador de desigualdad</strong>.</p><p>Compara los dos strings para que el código imprima <code>True</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;subscribed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" != \" /><text value=\"&quot;rejected&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"True\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>!=</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "True",
            "id": 76678,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Si la cadena de la izquierda no es igual a la cadena de la derecha, como en <code>\"subscribed\" != \"rejected\"</code>, el resultado es <code>True</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;subscribed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" != \" /><text value=\"&quot;rejected&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"32\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"True\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>\"subscribed\"</code> seguido de <code>!=</code> y finalmente <code>\"rejected\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
